          "current": "00c647e8 — suitable existing material, E1/G1.** Cases 14-a/b jointly require atom balance, particle-level catalysis and criterion-based environmental judgment. Equal function and time bounds make the 2300 kg CO2e partial advantage meaningful; identical 1.414 kg/h material CO2 is not double-counted. SCR conserves N8/H12/O6 and requires 51 kg NH3 for 90 kg NO, with the slip boundary stated. Poisoning and source-context mismatches are evaluated without invented prices, full LCA or blanket health claims. The explanatory mechanism serves the environmental decision."
