            "reason": "INDEPENDENT SEMANTIC PASS / KEEP exact inner profile. Comparable controlled deposition evidence supports Zn>Cu>Ag and the fresh Fe>Ni>Cu order; metal and metal-ion identities and charges are distinct. The given Zn/Cu standard cell value about1.10V and its electron direction are appropriate; the profile explicitly rejects carrying this voltage to Fe/Ni. Supplied controls and data are not invented observed reviewer/learner trials, and negative observations are not generalized beyond controlled conditions. Given cell reasoning stays within connecting measurements to the abbreviated series, without complete apparatus construction or Nernst/standard-potential calculation. The fresh species and new order supply transfer beyond memorizing the picture. Bilingual expectations and case answers agree. AI candidate only, needs_human_review, E1/G1; no practical performance or human attestation.",
