          "current": "5cdf490f — suitable existing material, E1/G1.** Cases 06-a/b demand a conserved acidic redox equation, time-local consumption rates and controlled product-seeding inference. Both induction shortening and the alternative baseline/product-rate model are interpretable without asserting a unique real manganese mechanism. The broader A-order is rightly left unproved. Heating/no-seeding and product inhibition are genuine changes. A schematic sigmoid is not treated as proof of autocatalysis."
