          "before": "Das Phosphatpaar mit beiden Abfangreaktionen, konkreten Le-Chatelier-Verschiebungen und endlichen Reserven deckt das geschlossene qualitative Modell.\nScope: Keine HH-Rechenpflicht; geschlossene Ansätze nach dosierter Zugabe und eine begrenzte Enzymanalogie, keine Aussage über das gesamte Blut oder Behandlung.\nActual informed artifact judgment source: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-16/chemie-current-nineteen-genuine-informed-P-design-bindings-20261016-v1/CANDIDATES.prospective-normal-P-profile-bodies.json",
          "current": "Actual complete DE/EN closed phosphate-buffer materials supply species and acid/base pulses. Bronsted1c142+LeChatelier5a24 are sufficient for qualitative reserve/balance explanation.5/5+1 gives6/4 or4/6; doubled reserve11/9;2/8+3acid gives5/5. NoHH/pKa/interference/clinical-selection duty. HE common optional phosphate theme remains owner-targeted. Separate outsideBY acquisition holds remain outside this P-design claim. Own current-context synthesis tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/HE-final-six-P-current-context-independent-a-v1/FIRST.own-final-six-P-current-context.before-record-serialization.json sha256:67ffb7e96e5c9abce5d06260753f92276d67c117a1d7071fe8d46e4785420cf6; original frozen whole-context science tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/HE-admission-current-independent-a-v1/FIRST.exact-HE-seven-wholes-four-views-source-and-admission.independent-a.science.frozen.json sha256:6a7f4dc40b4639ceb61849724b88a8cc644ea8dd1f7f163e148ddc47cc04b2ed. Whole profile/cases/criteria and unchanged actual resourcebytes retained. New own review identity/date bind the actual current requires/tags; no historical reviewer is reassigned. No new formalD/V/human/learner/whole-course acceptance is claimed."
        },
